cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "Temporal Refinement and ML-Driven Uncertainty Assessment of GEBCO Bathymetry in the Nigerian EEZ"
abstract: >-
  A reproducible pipeline that harmonises multiple annual GEBCO gridded
  bathymetry releases over the Nigerian Exclusive Economic Zone, derives
  temporal and terrain descriptors, and trains a machine-learning model that
  produces a refined depth estimate together with calibrated, conformalised
  per-cell uncertainty.
authors:
  - family-names: Dogiye
    given-names: Desmond
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
date-released: 2026-08-08
keywords:
  - bathymetry
  - GEBCO
  - machine learning
  - uncertainty quantification
  - conformal prediction
  - Nigerian EEZ
references:
